      "side": 1,
      "message": "So by customizing async pipeline creation, I mean the ability to extend it beyond merely calling `Initialize()` on a worker thread. You could imagine that async pipeline creation has multiple phases with dependencies like a graph of async tasks. We want to complete the async creation event at the end of the task graph, but there\u0027s no way to do that with the current interfaces in PipelineBase.\n\nA concrete example of what I want to achieve can be seen in this upcoming CL: https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/255573/21/src/dawn/native/metal/RenderPipelineMTL.mm",
